{"sections":[{"slug":"函数域","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"函数域"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">函数域</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“函数域”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">函数域是指有限域</span> $\\mathbb{F}_q$ <span lang=\"zh\">上不可约曲线的有理函数域</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">最简单的函数域是</span> $\\mathbb{A^1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的有理函数域</span> $\\mathbb{F}_q(t)$. <span lang=\"zh\">每个函数域都是</span> $\\mathbb{F}_q(t)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的有限扩张</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">每个函数域对应于唯一的光滑</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">射影</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">几何不可约</span> (geometrically irreducible) <span lang=\"zh\">曲线</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>, $\\mathbb{F}_q(t)$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span> $\\mathbb{P}^1$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/位","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">位</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体域</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/函数域类比","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">函数域类比</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Frobenius态射","text":"Frobenius <span lang=\"zh\">态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}